    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN our discord to be in on the development</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Cube Hero Odyssey</strong> is a hack-and-slash, monster slaying roguelite, where you play as a caped hero wielding his trusty anti-fragile blade.<br>Dive into combat with a myriad of creative build paths with skills and passive abilities! <br>Each playthrough promises a new experience as the world of Celestia is beautifully shown in colourful &amp; stylish procedurally generated maps!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954730/extras/c981abfab13a870c70e74c4880dc678a.poster.avif?t=1730763410\" width=600 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954730/extras/c981abfab13a870c70e74c4880dc678a.webm?t=1730763410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954730/extras/c981abfab13a870c70e74c4880dc678a.mp4?t=1730763410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud835\ude48\ud835\ude40\ud835\ude3e\ud835\ude43\ud835\ude3c\ud835\ude49\ud835\ude44\ud835\ude3e\ud835\ude3c\ud835\ude47 \ud835\ude4e\ud835\ude46\ud835\ude44\ud835\ude47\ud835\ude47 \ud835\ude48\ud835\ude40\ud835\ude40\ud835\ude4f\ud835\ude4e \ud835\ude4e\ud835\ude4f\ud835\ude4d\ud835\ude3c\ud835\ude4f\ud835\ude40\ud835\ude42\ud835\ude54</h2>Standard roguelites may have combat that feels closer to bullet hell, where your abilities can wipe out entire waves of minor enemies. <br>In Cube Hero Odyssey, combat is slow and methodical; each enemy can present a challenge to overcome! <br>Master dodging, attack with precise timing, and make strategic use of your skills as even a single enemy could take you down! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954730/extras/f2d5882d91e0ca1865ab8f913b5c4d5c.poster.avif?t=1730763410\" width=600 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954730/extras/f2d5882d91e0ca1865ab8f913b5c4d5c.webm?t=1730763410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954730/extras/f2d5882d91e0ca1865ab8f913b5c4d5c.mp4?t=1730763410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u279c \ud835\udde3\ud835\udde5\ud835\udde2\ud835\uddd6\ud835\uddd8\ud835\uddd7\ud835\udde8\ud835\udde5\ud835\uddd4\ud835\udddf\ud835\udddf\ud835\uddec \ud835\uddda\ud835\uddd8\ud835\udde1\ud835\uddd8\ud835\udde5\ud835\uddd4\ud835\udde7\ud835\uddd8\ud835\uddd7</h2>Each round features a uniquely designed environment, complete with varying hurdles and enemies lurking! From gentle greenery to fierce lava landscapes, explore to guarantee you claim all your loot!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u279c \ud835\udde0\ud835\uddd8\ud835\udde1\ud835\uddd4\ud835\uddd6\ud835\udddc\ud835\udde1\ud835\uddda \ud835\uddd5\ud835\udde2\ud835\udde6\ud835\udde6\ud835\uddd8\ud835\udde6</h2>Every few rounds, go head-to-head against colossal beasts, and test your might! Be careful with these giants... Or you'll be defeated in the blink of an eye!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u279c \ud835\uddd6\ud835\udde5\ud835\uddd8\ud835\uddd4\ud835\udde7\ud835\udddc\ud835\udde9\ud835\uddd8 \ud835\uddd6\ud835\udde2\ud835\udde0\ud835\uddd5\ud835\uddd4\ud835\udde7 \ud835\uddd5\ud835\udde8\ud835\udddc\ud835\udddf\ud835\uddd7\ud835\udde6</h2>Experiment with diverse builds and unlock powerful skills, tailoring your caped hero to your gameplay style for various tactical advantages! <br>The game provides 3 types of modifications, called <i>Mods</i>: Skill Mods (active skills), Stat Mods (stat upgrades), and Effect Mods (passive effects) as well as a newly added feature called Bloodlines, where you choose from one of the many character archetypes to have a distinguished start with unique traits!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u279c \ud835\udde5\ud835\udde2\ud835\uddda\ud835\udde8\ud835\uddd8\ud835\udddf\ud835\udddc\ud835\udde7\ud835\uddd8 \ud835\uddd8\ud835\udde1\ud835\uddd7\ud835\udddf\ud835\uddd8\ud835\udde6\ud835\udde6 \ud835\uddda\ud835\uddd4\ud835\udde0\ud835\uddd8\ud835\udde3\ud835\udddf\ud835\uddd4\ud835\uddec</h2>Dying is inevitable, and it'll put you back to round 1 where you can retry with your newly gained knowledge and practice. On top of that, you can craft a different build as you play to tackle your foes in a new way!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954730/extras/acfc26dbedad37cdbdc2d9bb1ea77500.poster.avif?t=1730763410\" width=600 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954730/extras/acfc26dbedad37cdbdc2d9bb1ea77500.webm?t=1730763410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954730/extras/acfc26dbedad37cdbdc2d9bb1ea77500.mp4?t=1730763410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud835\uddd6\ud835\uddfc\ud835\uddfb\ud835\uddfe\ud835\ude02\ud835\uddf2\ud835\uddff \ud835\ude01\ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddf2 \ud835\uddd6\ud835\udde8\ud835\uddd5\ud835\uddd8\ud835\udde6! \ud835\udde7\ud835\uddf5\ud835\uddf6\ud835\ude00 \ud835\uddf6\ud835\ude00 \ud835\uddec\ud835\udde2\ud835\udde8\ud835\udde5 \ud835\udde2\ud835\uddd7\ud835\uddec\ud835\udde6\ud835\udde6\ud835\uddd8\ud835\uddec!</h2>Cube Hero Odyssey caters to everyone who enjoys mastering combat systems and evolving their approach through inventive gameplay strategies! The game offers a rich blend of challenging encounters and creative build paths, ideal for players looking for an engaging roguelite experience in a colourful, cute cube-like world. <br><br><strong>Paraverse Studio</strong> is a team of three. And this is our first foray into the roguelite genre. We are actively working on the game regularly.<br>Join our  to share your ideas or any thoughts, and contribute to the game's development. Or, just come to chat!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Cube Hero Odyssey</strong> is a hack-and-slash, monster slaying roguelite, where you play as a caped hero wielding his trusty anti-fragile blade.<br>Dive into combat with a myriad of creative build paths with skills and passive abilities! <br>Each playthrough promises a new experience as the world of Celestia is beautifully shown in colourful &amp; stylish procedurally generated maps!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954730/extras/c981abfab13a870c70e74c4880dc678a.poster.avif?t=1730763410\" width=600 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954730/extras/c981abfab13a870c70e74c4880dc678a.webm?t=1730763410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954730/extras/c981abfab13a870c70e74c4880dc678a.mp4?t=1730763410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud835\ude48\ud835\ude40\ud835\ude3e\ud835\ude43\ud835\ude3c\ud835\ude49\ud835\ude44\ud835\ude3e\ud835\ude3c\ud835\ude47 \ud835\ude4e\ud835\ude46\ud835\ude44\ud835\ude47\ud835\ude47 \ud835\ude48\ud835\ude40\ud835\ude40\ud835\ude4f\ud835\ude4e \ud835\ude4e\ud835\ude4f\ud835\ude4d\ud835\ude3c\ud835\ude4f\ud835\ude40\ud835\ude42\ud835\ude54</h2>Standard roguelites may have combat that feels closer to bullet hell, where your abilities can wipe out entire waves of minor enemies. <br>In Cube Hero Odyssey, combat is slow and methodical; each enemy can present a challenge to overcome! <br>Master dodging, attack with precise timing, and make strategic use of your skills as even a single enemy could take you down! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954730/extras/f2d5882d91e0ca1865ab8f913b5c4d5c.post